ckground-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"> <div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeR713inYuJ/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by WTA (@wta)</a></p></div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><h4>Second quarter</h4>\n<h5>First-round match to keep an eye on</h5>\n<p><strong>Clara Tauson vs. Marie Bouzkova: </strong>This time last year, Denmark's Tauson was seeded No. 10 in Wuhan, and reached the third round. But she has struggled with a back injury for much of the 2026 season, and arrives in Wuhan with a current ranking of No. 42. This first-round match poses a strong contrast in styles, with in-form Bouzkova's first-rate counterpunching game and foot speed an intriguing match for Tauson's first-strike tennis.</p>\n<p><strong>Additional first-round matches: </strong>[WC] Dayana Yastremska vs. Cristina Bucsa, [16] Maja Chwalinska vs. Mayar Sherif, [10] Iva Jovic vs. [WC] Mia Pohankova, [WC] Wang Xiyu vs. Wang Xinyu, Maria Sakkari vs. Donna Vekic</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n<section\n    class=\"widget embeddable-widget page-grid rankings-global rankings-global--embedded theme-purple has-bg\"\n    data-init-when-visible=\"true\"\n    data-widget=\"rankings-global/tabs\"\n>\n    <div class=\"rankings-global__header\">\n        <div class=\"rankings-global__header-logo\">\n                <img src=\"/resources/v7.53.14/i/elements/piflogo-white.png\" alt=\"label.logo.globalRankings\" class=\"rankings-global__header-logo-image\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"198\" height=\"64\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rankings-global__sd-toggle segmented-controls segmented-controls--icons\">\n            <button class=\"segmented-controls__item segmented-controls__item--icon is-active js-type-toggle\" data-view=\"singles\" aria-label=\"label.singles\">\n\t<svg class=\"icon segmented-controls__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t<use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"/resources/v7.53.14/i/svg-output/icons.svg#icn-singles\"></use>\n\t</svg>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"segmented-controls__item segmented-controls__item--icon js-type-toggle\" data-view=\"doubles\" aria-label=\"label.doubles\">\n\t<svg class=\"icon segmented-controls__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n\t\t<use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"/resources/v7.53.14/i/svg-output/icons.svg#icn-doubles\"></use>\n\t</svg>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rankings-global__rankings-list js-singles-rankings rankings-global__rankings-list--full-width\">\n        \n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rankings-global__rankings-list js-doubles-rankings u-hide rankings-global__rankings-list--full-width\">\n        \n    </div>\n</section>\n</div><h5>Potential quarterfinal showdown</h5>\n<p><strong>[3] Mirra Andreeva vs. [8] Marta Kostyuk: </strong>The burgeoning rivalry between Andreeva, who's into the final this week in Beijing, and Kostyuk has blossomed in 2026. The two young stars never faced each other on the WTA Tour Driven by Mercedes-Benz before this year, but could be on tap for a fifth head-to-head match here. Kostyuk has won three of them -- including both hard-court matches -- but Andreeva won the biggest, earlier this year at Roland Garros.</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n        <aside class=\"instagram-post embeddable-widget embeddable-widget--floating embeddable-widget--centered-mobile \"><blockquote class=\"instagram-media\" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeTsgmuGtLX/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" data-instgrm-version=\"14\" style=\" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);\"><div style=\"padding:16px;\"> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeTsgmuGtLX/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;\" target=\"_blank\"> <div style=\" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;\"> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; bord