t: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(0px) translateY(7px);\"></div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; height: 12.5px; transform: rotate(-45deg) translateX(3px) translateY(1px); width: 12.5px; flex-grow: 0; margin-right: 14px; margin-left: 2px;\"></div> <div style=\"background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; height: 12.5px; width: 12.5px; transform: translateX(9px) translateY(-18px);\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 8px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 20px; width: 20px;\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px solid transparent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: auto;\"> <div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div> <div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div></div></div> <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\"> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div> <div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div></div></a><p style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:17px; margin-bottom:0; margin-top:8px; overflow:hidden; padding:8px 0 7px; text-align:center; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DeTsgmuGtLX/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" style=\" color:#c9c8cd; font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-style:normal; font-weight:normal; line-height:17px; text-decoration:none;\" target=\"_blank\">A post shared by WTA (@wta)</a></p></div></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"//www.instagram.com/embed.js\"></script></aside>\n</div><h4>Third quarter</h4>\n<h5>First-round match to keep an eye on</h5>\n<p><strong>Lilli Tagger vs. Nikola Bartunkova: </strong>Bartunkova is coming off a banner week in Beijing, where she upset Sabalenka on the way to the semifinals, while Tagger has scuffled to a 1-4 main-draw record since winning her first tour-level singles title in Prague in July. But these two rising talents possess two of the most varied playing styles on tour, making their first of what may be many tour-level meetings a tantalizing prospect.</p>\n<p><strong>Additional first-round matches: </strong>Katerina Siniakova vs. Liudmila Samsonova, Kimberly Birrell vs. Qualifier, [WC] Guo Hanyu vs. [12] Sorana Cirstea, [15] Jasmine Paolini vs. Sara Bejlek, Anhelina Kalinina vs. Sonay Kartal</p>\n<h5>Potential quarterfinal showdown</h5>\n<p><strong>[4] Linda Noskova vs. [5] Elina Svitolina: </strong>With Noskova already qualified for the year-end championships, and Svitolina chasing a spot, the Ukrainian likely will be motivated for a big result in Wuhan to help her cause. The two have not played since Noskova became a Grand Slam champion at Wimbledon in July, but played for the first time in two years on the clay courts of Stuttgart in April. Svitolina won that one in a tight two, 7-6(2), 7-5, and the margins could be equally slim in a reprise.</p><div class=\"articleWidget center\">\n</div><h4>Fourth quarter</h4>\n<h5>First-round match to keep an eye on</h5>\n<p><strong>Ekaterina Alexandrova vs. Leylah Fernandez: </strong>Recently-crowned Singapore champion Fernandez lost her first match in Beijing, but will look to use her Asian Swing hot streak to reverse fortunes against Alexandrova, whom she's lost to three times in four career meetings. Alexandrova, meanwhile, hopes to parlay a quarterfinal effort in Beijing into another deep WTA 1000 run in China. The last two matches between these two have stretched deep into a third set.</p>\n<p><strong>Additional first-round matches: </strong>Yuliia Starodubtseva vs. Qualifier, Qualifier vs. Qualifier, [11] Diana Shnaider vs. Katie Boulter, [13] Alexandra Eala vs. Qualifier, Jelena Ostapenko vs. Qualifier</p>\n<h5>Potential quarterfinal showdown</h5>\n<p><strong>[2] Jessica Pegula vs. [6] Karolina Muchova</strong>: The third career meeting between Pegula and Muchova could be on tap for the last eight in Wuhan. Pegula is 2-0 in the head-to-head, but both victories unfolded in comeback fashion for the American from a set behind. </p>\n<p>While Pegula and Muchova are the highest seeds in this second, also lurking here is No. 13 seed Alexandra Eala -- a projected third-round opponent for Pegula. Eala will face a qualifier in the first round, and the winner of Alexandrova and Fernandez in the second.</p>",
